[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4518746070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119655#issuecomment-4518746070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119655","id":4518746070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDVaX1g","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T12:44:29Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T12:44:29Z","body":"> controls are added as internal children and are not accessible via regular child iteration.\r\n\r\n`get_children(true)` returns internal children.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4518746070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4520223895","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119655#issuecomment-4520223895","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119655","id":4520223895,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDW0klw","user":{"login":"Voyend","id":146948396,"node_id":"U_kgDOCMJBLA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146948396?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend","html_url":"https://github.com/Voyend","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T15:51:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T15:51:03Z","body":"> > controls are added as internal children and are not accessible via regular child iteration.\n> \n> `get_children(true)` returns internal children.\n\nYou're right, `get_children(true)` does return internal children.\nHowever, it returns all internal children without distinguishing which ones were added as title bar controls.\nThe proposed methods provide a dedicated, explicit API for accessing only the title bar controls, which is consistent with how `add_title_bar_control` and `remove_title_bar_control` already form their own title bar control API.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4520223895/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4524730149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119655#issuecomment-4524730149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119655","id":4524730149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDbHnJQ","user":{"login":"Voyend","id":146948396,"node_id":"U_kgDOCMJBLA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146948396?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend","html_url":"https://github.com/Voyend","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-23T08:07:24Z","updated_at":"2026-05-23T08:07:24Z","body":"## Testing\n\nI tested this PR by building the engine successfully (GitHub Actions CI passed) \nand running the following GDScript test:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    for child: Node in get_children():\n        if not child is Control:\n            continue\n        \n        add_title_bar_control(child)\n        var count: int = get_title_bar_control_count()\n        print(\"Index: %s, Name: %s\" % [count - 1, get_title_bar_control(count - 1)])\n```\n\n**Output:**\n```\nIndex: 0, Name: Host:<Button#26860324322>\nIndex: 1, Name: Join:<Button#26910655973>\nIndex: 2, Name: Setting:<Button#26960987624>\n```\n\nBoth new methods work as expected:\n- `get_title_bar_control_count()` returns the correct count\n- `get_title_bar_control(index)` returns the correct Control for each index\n\nDocs:\n\n![Screenshot_20260523010609.png](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3904275f-ccae-4e75-9580-b44ee502f173)\n\n![Screenshot_20260523010543.png](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0b0c4ba-8ff1-420a-929e-84e98dac4acd)\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4524730149/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4545110463","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119655#issuecomment-4545110463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119655","id":4545110463,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDujhvw","user":{"login":"Voyend","id":146948396,"node_id":"U_kgDOCMJBLA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146948396?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend","html_url":"https://github.com/Voyend","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-26T14:34:50Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T14:34:50Z","body":"I tried to rename `master` branch to `add-getters`, I thought it has no impact, I'm still new to pull requests and this is my first one, I'll reopen it or a new one, sorry for that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions